  "title": "Homer's Iliad",
  "summary": "The Iliad, an epic poem about the tenth year of the Trojan War, was composed in Greek around the eighth century BCE and credited by tradition to Homer. It came out of a long oral tradition, probably in the Ionian Greek world, and the circumstances of its writing down are not well understood.",
